---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
---
<Section eyebrow="Why Codevil">
  <div class="grid gap-10 sm:grid-cols-3">
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Real-time shared rooms</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-fg-3">
        You and your teammates connect to one session at the same time. Everyone sees the
        agent think, call tools, and write code as it happens. Everyone can direct it.
        Actions are attributed — you always know who did what.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Direct the agent conversationally</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-fg-3">
        No approval gates by default. Send an Agent Request, the agent runs, you watch and
        steer in real time. Flip on <span class="font-mono text-sm text-fg-2">plan first</span>
        when you want a plan to review and annotate before execution.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Self-hosted by default</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-fg-3">
        Deploys to your own Cloudflare account. No tenant rows, no proxy billing, no data
        leaving your infrastructure. The Cloudflare account is the team boundary. Your code,
        your keys, your rules.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>
